        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.55,
          "end": 31.53,
          "en": "So whilst showing this input field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.53,
          "end": 35.283,
          "en": "and it should say save whilst the input field is visible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.39,
          "end": 39.72,
          "en": "Now therefore of course, will need to manage some state here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.72,
          "end": 42.69,
          "en": "because we want to manage some data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.69,
          "end": 47.69,
          "en": "that in the end, should cause the UI to update when changed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.7,
          "end": 51.03,
          "en": "Therefore, of course, as you learned, we can and should",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.03,
          "end": 55.593,
          "en": "import useState from the React library like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.46,
          "end": 60.93,
          "en": "to create such a state value and get access to a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.93,
          "end": 63.72,
          "en": "that allows us to update that value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 63.72,
          "end": 67.353,
          "en": "And that allows us to tell React to update the UI.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.03,
          "end": 71.34,
          "en": "And for that we call useState like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.34,
          "end": 75.36,
          "en": "As you learned, we can set an initial value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 75.36,
          "end": 78.9,
          "en": "and we'll get back an array with exactly two elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 78.9,
          "end": 81.6,
          "en": "And therefore here I'll use array destructuring",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 81.6,
          "end": 85.113,
          "en": "to store these two elements in separate constants.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 86.31,
          "end": 90.06,
          "en": "Now I'll name my first constant here Is Editing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 90.06,
          "end": 94.35,
          "en": "and my second constant Set Is Editing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 94.35,
          "end": 97.2,
          "en": "because I plan to store the information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 97.2,
          "end": 99.96000000000001,
          "en": "whether we currently are editing the player",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 99.96000000000001,
          "end": 102.063,
          "en": "or not in this state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 103.02000000000001,
          "end": 106.74000000000001,
          "en": "Therefore, the goal is to manage a Boolean value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 106.74000000000001,
          "end": 109.62,
          "en": "true or false, in this state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 109.62,
          "end": 113.22,
          "en": "And I'll set this to an initial value of false",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 113.22,
          "end": 116.34,
          "en": "so that initially we're not editing the player",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 116.34,
          "end": 118.97999999999999,
          "en": "and we're not showing an input field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 118.97999999999999,
          "end": 122.73,
          "en": "But now with that, here's a little exercise for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 122.73,
          "end": 125.49,
          "en": "Build up on this state here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 125.49,
          "end": 129.36,
          "en": "no pun intended, and make sure that this button here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 129.36,
          "end": 134.36,
          "en": "triggers a function which sets is editing to true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 134.76,
          "end": 139.47,
