          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 154.44,
          "end": 157.23,
          "en": "to pause the video and try this on your own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 157.23,
          "end": 159.903,
          "en": "Thereafter, we'll implement this together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 164.07,
          "end": 166.07999999999998,
          "en": "So did you succeed?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 166.07999999999998,
          "end": 169.11,
          "en": "Let's now add this functionality together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 169.11,
          "end": 172.02,
          "en": "And I'll start by adding a new function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 172.02,
          "end": 174.63,
          "en": "a function inside of this component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 174.63,
          "end": 177.6,
          "en": "because it is a function that will use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 177.6,
          "end": 180.09,
          "en": "this set is editing state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 180.09,
          "end": 183.27,
          "en": "updating function provided by React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 183.27,
          "end": 185.55,
          "en": "and therefore this function must be provided",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 185.55,
          "end": 189.963,
